{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001810806","cik":"0001810806","slug":"unity-software-810806","name":"Unity Software Inc.","ticker":"U","exchanges":["NYSE"],"sector":"Services-Prepackaged Software","sic":"7372","country":"CA","website":"","listed_years":5.4,"first_annual":"2021-03-05","last_filing":"2026-07-27","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001810806&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Unity Software Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Prepackaged Software\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $1.9bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 16.8% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 30.8%.","Listed on NYSE, it funds itself from operations ($71.8m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 16.8% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $508.2m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810806/000181080626000032/0001810806-26-000032-index.htm","accession":"0001810806-26-000032"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $71.8m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810806/000181080626000032/0001810806-26-000032-index.htm","accession":"0001810806-26-000032"},{"text":"Net cash of $2.2bn against total assets of $6.5bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810806/000181080626000032/0001810806-26-000032-index.htm","accession":"0001810806-26-000032"}],"bear":[{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 73.8% to 30.8% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810806/000181080626000032/0001810806-26-000032-index.htm","accession":"0001810806-26-000032"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-69.1% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810806/000181080626000032/0001810806-26-000032-index.htm","accession":"0001810806-26-000032"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $223.5m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810806/000181080626000032/0001810806-26-000032-index.htm","accession":"0001810806-26-000032"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 5.4% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810806/000181080626000032/0001810806-26-000032-index.htm","accession":"0001810806-26-000032"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 4.8% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (198,321 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810806/000214441826000003/0002144418-26-000003-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.9% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810806/000214441826000003/0002144418-26-000003-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 23.0% for 2 consecutiv